DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42579::$$$message_0342_0000_0000$$$::"Wait, Shirou Emiya."::
42580::$$$message_0342_0000_0001$$$::"Kotomine!? What are you doing here?"::
42581::$$$message_0342_0000_0002$$$::"I too am a son of man. What is so strange about my bringing Servants with me to this onsen?"::
42582::$$$message_0342_0000_0003$$$::"...Um, everything."::
42583::$$$message_0342_0000_0004$$$::"Shirou, we don't have time to deal with him. Let's hurry."::
42584::$$$message_0342_0000_0005$$$::"Did you not hear me? I told you to wait. I never said you could pass."::
42585::$$$message_0342_0000_0006$$$::"Why is everyone trying to stop us!? I just want to go eat onsen eggs with Saber!"::
42586::$$$message_0342_0000_0007$$$::"Ha ha ha.[lr]::
42587::$$$message_0342_0000_0008$$$::The reason is extremely simple. Because I enjoy obstructing you."::
42588::$$$message_0342_0000_0009$$$::"He's rotten to the core."::
42589::$$$message_0342_0000_0010$$$::"I'm glad you understand.[lr]::
42590::$$$message_0342_0000_0011$$$::Now, lose yourself in the pits of disappointment!"::
42591::$$$message_0342_0000_0012$$$::"You...[wvs][wait canskip=0 time=200][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSHI6_SHI_0050 _name=士郎]you rotten priest!"::
42592::$$$message_0342_0000_0013$$$::"Ha ha ha. Thank you, truly."::
42593::$$$message_0342_0001_0000$$$::"It's a rare opportunity to see Kiritsugu's son and the King of Knights give up on their dreams and lose hope. I shall enjoy this like the finest wine."::
42594::$$$message_0342_0001_0001$$$::"That's not what we discussed, Kotomine."::
42595::$$$message_0342_0001_0002$$$::"Gilgamesh!"::
42596::$$$message_0342_0001_0003$$$::"Hm. Be at ease, young man. Your wish will not go to waste."::
42597::$$$message_0342_0001_0004$$$::"What's that supposed to mean?"::
42598::$$$message_0342_0001_0005$$$::"You still don't get it, mongrel? I'm taking Saber with me, and then I'll treat her to the best onsen eggs this world has ever seen."::
42599::$$$message_0342_0001_0006$$$::"Wha..."::
42600::$$$message_0342_0001_0007$$$::"That's how this ends, mongrel. I'll lead her to the pleasure you weren't able to give her. Now be a good dog and get lost."::
42601::$$$message_0342_0001_0008$$$::"Grr."::
42602::$$$message_0342_0001_0009$$$::"You heard him. Saber will get what she desires, whether you win or lose. I don't know whether it's what [font italic=true]you[font italic=false] wanted, though."::
42603::$$$message_0342_0001_0010$$$::"...Hey. The lad came all this way. At least let him eat some eggs."::
42604::$$$message_0342_0001_0011$$$::"Shut your mouth, Lancer, before I feed you Kotomine's mapo tofu again."::
42605::$$$message_0342_0001_0012$$$::"...Well, you heard him. Nothing personal."::
42606::$$$message_0342_0001_0013$$$::"...R-right."::
42607::$$$message_0342_0001_0014$$$::"Shirou, we have no reason to take this challenge."::
42608::$$$message_0342_0001_0015$$$::"Oh, have you already admitted defeat, Saber?"::
42609::$$$message_0342_0001_0016$$$::"Rrgh."::
42610::$$$message_0342_0001_0017$$$::"We can't talk this out with them, Saber. We have to do this!"::
42611::$$$message_0342_0001_0018$$$::"It looks like you're right!":�)